# cincaiAndroid Disclaimer


---

### Kadazan Version

**KADA kotigog ko dati do ogundop HP nu.**
Ong nu mongimpit flash mogulambang (*a.k.a. “Blind Pigging”*), jaga-jaga…
*handphone* nu oku noh **ogundop**.

cincaiAndroid mantad 100% FREE do popogunaan.
Tapi ong nu oku do’ongo om nunu do pomogunaan nu, kaadaan nu nga’ada **mogunsamang** (sosopon tanpa hasil).

---

⚠️ *Ogundop* = “cease to live / completely perish.”
⚠️ *Mogulambang* = reckless, membabi buta (Blind Pigging).
⚠️ *Mogunsamang* = wasted effort.

